    "text": "package Anonymous_Access_To_Subprogram is\n\n   procedure Proc\n     (P : access procedure (I : in out Integer));\n\nend Anonymous_Access_To_Subprogram;\n\npackage body Anonymous_Access_To_Subprogram is\n\n   procedure Proc\n     (P : access procedure (I : in out Integer))\n   is\n      I : Integer := 0;\n   begin\n      P (I);\n   end Proc;\n\nend Anonymous_Access_To_Subprogram;\n",
